.TH ELECTROGRIDY 1 "2026" "electrogridy" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
electrogridy \- editor for single-line electrical diagrams
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B electrogridy
.RI [ file ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B electrogridy
draws single-line diagrams for photovoltaic systems, transformer stations
and low-voltage distribution boards in a CAD-style environment working in
millimetres, and prints or plots them up to A0.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I file
Drawing (.grdy) to open at start.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I *.grdy
Drawing files (JSON, MIME type application/x-electrogridy).
.TP
.I *.grdylib
Block libraries.
.TP
.I *.grdyframe
Frame templates.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/electrogridy/
User block library and frame templates.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/electrogridy/
Automatic backups, offered for recovery after a crash.
.TP
.I /usr/share/electrogridy/
Shipped symbol library and frame templates.
